      <div class="seg b1">The exposure<small>what your tools can reach</small></div>
      <div class="seg b2">The evidence<small>what has actually happened</small></div>
      <div class="seg b3">The fix<small>seven practical controls</small></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

